This repository is released under two licenses. Which one applies depends on the file's location.

  Part A — MIT License
    scripts/          (CLI, search, installer, auditor, build and test tooling)
    engine/           (taste-profile engine)
    tests/
    SKILL.md
    package.json, tsconfig.json and other build configuration

  Part B — Lumina Open UI License 1.0
    tokens/           (palettes, typography, base tokens)
    components/       (UI encyclopedia, motion utilities, chart engines)
    blueprints/       (page blueprints)
    references/       (design guidance)
    preview/          (showcase gallery)
    catalog.json

If a file is not listed above, Part A applies.

